3. Third-party data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The licences above cover only original work in this repository: the writing,
the compilation and structure of the data, the Prestige and Difficulty indexes
and their methodology, and the code.

They do not cover material owned by others, which remains under its owners'
terms. This includes ranking positions published by U.S. News & World Report,
Forbes, QS, Times Higher Education and ShanghaiRanking (ARWU); figures and
wording taken from university websites and Common Data Set documents; and
other cited sources. Each fact carries a citation to its source.

Data from U.S. federal sources (College Scorecard, IPEDS, NOAA climate
normals) is a work of the U.S. Government and is in the public domain in the
United States.
